<!doctype html>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Cart flow — design mock</title>
<!--
  cart-design.html — A PAPER PROTOTYPE. Not wired to anything, not deployed, not linked from the app.

  Athi, 2026-08-08: *"be in the design mode, just keep it in local for the cart design, we go through the entire
  flow, once confirmed, then you can implement… in this we do not want the left half, we are going to show just the
  product list and the cart, nothing else, once all the selection is over, then we show the rest in order one by one."*

  ── WHAT THIS CHANGES ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Compose today puts EVERYTHING on one screen: send-as, priority, recipients, subject, delivery date, address, note,
  and the catalogue — two dense columns, and the thing you actually came to do (choose what you are ordering) is in
  the right-hand half of it. On a phone that is unusable, and on a desktop it is still a wall.

  So: one job per step. The cart gets the whole width because choosing what to order is the longest, most
  back-and-forth part of the task — you scroll, search, change your mind, adjust a quantity. Everything else is a
  short form, and short forms are better one at a time than crowded together.

  This is the "more panes, not a denser pane" rule the app already follows, applied to the screen that needed it most.

  ── WHAT IS DELIBERATELY DECIDED HERE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  · The cart bar is STICKY. It is the running answer to "what am I ordering and what does it come to", and it must
    not scroll away behind a long catalogue.
  · You cannot leave step 1 with an empty cart — Next is disabled and says why. A chit with no lines is not a chit.
  · Steps you have not reached are not clickable; steps you HAVE passed are, so going back to change a quantity is
    one tap and does not lose anything.
  · The last step restates the whole order before it can be sent. Nothing is sent from a screen that does not show
    what is being sent.
  · Typing a one-off item and the AI line stay ON STEP 1 — they are ways of adding a line, so they belong with the
    other way of adding a line, not on a step of their own.

  Open it directly in a browser. It carries its own sample data and its own smoke test (bottom of the file).
-->
<script src="app/catalogue-lines.js"></script>
<script src="app/cart-ui.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#1d2530; --grey:#6a707a; --line:#e3e6ea; --paper:#f7f8fa; --blue:#3F66A6; --blue-soft:#eef4ff;
    --gold-soft:#FBF6E9; --gold-line:#efe3c4; --good:#2c7a43; --warn:#8a5a1e;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:#eef0f4;color:var(--ink);
       font:15px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif}
  .shell{max-width:720px;margin:22px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;
         box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(20,30,50,.13);display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:88vh}
  .hd{padding:15px 18px 0}
  .hd .t{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:800;font-size:17px}
  .hd .s{color:var(--grey);font-size:12.5px;margin:2px 0 0}
  .x{margin-left:auto;border:0;background:none;font-size:23px;color:#9aa3a7;cursor:pointer;line-height:1}

  /* ── The step rail. Passed steps are tappable; steps ahead are not — you cannot skip the cart. ── */
  .rail{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:13px 18px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);overflow-x:auto}
  .st{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12.5px;
      white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--grey)}
  .st.done{border-color:#cfe0d6;background:#f2f9f5;color:var(--good);cursor:pointer}
  .st.now{border-color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700}
  .st .n{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,0,0,.08);display:inline-flex;
         align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}
  .st.now .n{background:rgba(255,255,255,.24)}

  .body{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:0 18px 16px;position:relative}
  .foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:11px 18px;display:flex;gap:10px;background:#fff}
  .foot button{flex:1;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
  .foot .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-color:var(--blue)}
  .foot button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}

  /* ── Cart bar: the running answer, always in view. ── */
  .cart{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:12px 0 10px;
        padding:11px 13px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper)}
  .cart.on{border-color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-soft)}
  .bag{position:relative;font-size:20px;line-height:1}
  .bag b{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-9px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:9px;min-width:18px;
         height:18px;padding:0 4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;line-height:18px;text-align:center}
  .cart .sum{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
  .cart .lnk{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
  .cart .mut{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--grey);cursor:pointer}

  .srch{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px}
  .grp{padding:11px 2px 3px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .grp b{font-size:13.5px}
  .grp .m{font-size:11px;color:var(--grey)}
  .grp .inc{font-size:11px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:700}
  .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 2px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .row.var{padding-left:20px}
  .row.in{background:var(--blue-soft)}
  .row .nm{flex:1}
  .row .nm b{font-size:13.5px}
  .row .u{color:var(--grey);font-size:11.5px}
  .row .p{font-size:12px;color:var(--grey);margin-top:1px}
  .row .p .lt{color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}
  .stp{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .rb{border-radius:50%;width:28px;height:28px;flex:none;border:1.5px solid var(--blue);background:#fff;color:var(--blue);
      font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .rb.f{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}
  .qi{width:46px;padding:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;text-align:center}

  .sec{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--grey);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:17px 0 7px}
  label.fl{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--grey);margin:9px 0 3px}
  .inp{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;background:#fff}
  .two{display:flex;gap:10px}.two>*{flex:1}
  .note{background:var(--gold-soft);border:1px solid var(--gold-line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;
        font-size:12.5px;color:#6b5a36;margin:10px 0}
  .chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;
        padding:4px 10px;font-size:12.5px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;background:#fff}
  .chip .rm{cursor:pointer;color:#9aa3a7;font-weight:800}
  .rev{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:8px}
  .rev .h{background:var(--paper);padding:8px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--grey);
          text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;display:flex}
  .rev .h .e{margin-left:auto;color:var(--blue);cursor:pointer;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:11.5px}
  .rev .r{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
  .rev .r .k{min-width:104px;color:var(--grey);font-size:11.5px}
  .tot{display:flex;padding:10px 12px;border-top:2px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;font-weight:800}
  .empty{padding:26px 2px;color:var(--grey);font-size:13px;text-align:center}
  .warnl{color:var(--warn);font-size:11.5px;margin:6px 0 0}
  /* ── The cart popup. Opens OVER the list so the list keeps its scroll and its search. ── */
  .cbcart-ov,.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(15,22,32,.5);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:14px;z-index:40}
  .cbcart-ov.on,.ov.on{display:flex}
  .ovc{background:#fff;width:100%;max-width:470px;border-radius:15px;padding:17px 18px 20px;max-height:86vh;overflow:auto}
</style>

<div class="shell">
  <div class="hd">
    <div class="t"><span>✉️</span><span id="hTitle">Compose — author a chit</span>
      <button class="x" title="close (mock)">×</button></div>
    <div class="s" id="hSub">create your own record, then bridge it</div>
  </div>
  <div class="rail" id="rail"></div>
  <div class="body" id="body"></div>
  <div class="foot" id="foot"></div>
</div>
<div class="cbcart-ov" id="cartov" onclick="if(event.target===this)CBCart.close('cc')"><div class="ovc" id="cartovc"></div></div>

